id: SECRETS-002
title: Azure AD Client Secret
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
  content_contains: azure
patterns:
  - regex: ~[A-Za-z0-9_~.]{34}
    message: Azure AD client secret detected. This credential allows authentication as your application.
fix: Rotate the secret in Azure Portal > App Registrations > Certificates & Secrets. Store secrets in Azure Key Vault or use managed identities.
